title: "Pixels, Not Headers: Screenshot-Mediated Business Email Compromise Against AI Office Agents"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
url: https://github.com/vasquezbrandon205/pixel-bec
repository-code: https://github.com/vasquezbrandon205/pixel-bec
