keywords:
  - prompt-injection
  - multimodal-safety
  - business-email-compromise
  - AI-agents
  - provenance
  - falsification
abstract: >
  Screenshot-mediated BEC against AI office agents: agents resist imperative
  instructions embedded in images but adopt declarative factual claims
  laundered through judgment tasks. Threat model, discovery narrative with
  pre-registered oracles, a deployable provenance-tagging + consequence-
  gating defense (runnable deterministic middleware), and a blinded
  replication protocol. Honest small-n, contaminated-subject limitations
  stated throughout.
